<title>USA: Cytec Industries names officer.</title>
<headline>Cytec Industries names officer.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PATERSON, N.J. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cytec Industries Inc said Tuesday it named David Lilley as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Lilley, who is to assume the positions on Wednesday, comes from American Home Products where he was a vice president, it said.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said the company recently created the position of chief operating officer, while Darryl Fry, its chief executive officer, was reliquishing the post of president.</p>
<p>Cytec Industries Inc is an industrial chemical company.</p>
</text>
